{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1227500-merlin-tv-show","id":1227500,"title":"Merlin (TV Show)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-14T12:57:59-07:00","id":1227500,"title":"Merlin (TV Show)","content":"Been rewatching Merlin after some years and despite whatever people might think of the show it is great for coming up with ideas for Verbana. It's got a nice strong druidic inspiration for the magic it uses and most of the time it is feels like a nice strong real part of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T13:24:49-07:00","id":1227506,"title":"","content":"I generally got tired of characters being killed off through being thrown against a wall. Aside from a few rare cases of people being poisoned or stabbed or similar, &quot;thrown against a wall&quot; was the leading cause of death. Why?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T13:35:12-07:00","id":1227509,"title":"","content":"Oh I fully agree that the show got tiresome after a while which is why I said despite whatever people might think of the show. I was more trying to bring up how much I like the way magic is presented in the show (most of the time)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T13:46:22-07:00","id":1227512,"title":"","content":"Well Merlin's magic (the show's magic), to me, feels like it runs the line between Verbena and Hermetic. Incantations and thought-forms, religion mixing with magic...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T14:48:01-07:00","id":1227528,"title":"","content":"Well I've always had a bit of an issue with the New Age Witch stereotype Verbana (although I fully believe that most modern day recruits would be brought in from practitioners of Wicca and/or Witchcraft). It might have something to do with my anthropological interests in ancient cultures beliefs in religion, magic, and the supernatural. Druids had a very ritualistic and secretive belief system that wouldn't seem too out of place with the Hermetics (The OoH even had a Druid House if I remember correctly). Religion and magic were two sides of the same coin to druids as magic to them was the asking of favors from gods but it required specific actions and rituals for it to work (this of course is a very simplistic explanation as entire theses have been written on the subject).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}